WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.147 --> 00:00:17.589
next morning, Vinnie overslept.

2
00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:20.231
He ran to the attic.

3
00:00:21.312 --> 00:00:25.015
He wanted to make sure their trip to Egypt wasn’t a dream.

4
00:00:25.916 --> 00:00:28.178
He hoped Mandy was already there.

5
00:00:29.239 --> 00:00:30.120
But she wasn’t.

6
00:00:31.768 --> 00:00:36.129
Disappointed, Vinnie came downstairs and went outside.

7
00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:39.490
His dad was about to mow the lawn.

8
00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:43.471
“Dad,” said Vinnie, “where’s Mandy?”

9
00:00:43.491 --> 00:00:47.272
“She went shopping with Mom,” Dad replied.

10
00:00:48.373 --> 00:00:49.593
He couldn’t believe it.

11
00:00:49.613 --> 00:00:53.274
“Doesn’t she want to go on another photo trip?”

12
00:00:53.774 --> 00:00:54.254
he thought.

13
00:00:55.115 --> 00:00:57.475
Suddenly Vinnie had an idea.

14
00:00:57.495 --> 00:01:00.136
“What if I go by myself?

15
00:01:01.256 --> 00:01:03.318
Mandy won’t even know I’m gone!”

16
00:01:04.999 --> 00:01:06.960
Vinnie raced back to the attic.

17
00:01:07.981 --> 00:01:10.903
He took the photo of Egypt out of his pocket.

18
00:01:11.863 --> 00:01:12.564
He stared.

19
00:01:13.445 --> 00:01:14.906
The picture had changed.

20
00:01:15.926 --> 00:01:19.168
The old man and the eagle in the boat were gone.

21
00:01:20.489 --> 00:01:23.311
In their places sat Vinnie and Mandy.

22
00:01:23.331 --> 00:01:32.281
“Every time we come back from a photo trip,” Vinnie thought, “will we be in the picture?

23
00:01:33.341 --> 00:01:35.363
There’s only one way to find out.”

24
00:01:36.263 --> 00:01:40.385
Vinnie carefully put the picture of Egypt into the photo album.

25
00:01:41.626 --> 00:01:44.307
His heart began to race as he turned the page.

26
00:01:45.328 --> 00:01:50.471
In the next photo, the old man was sitting near a brightly glowing object.

27
00:01:51.631 --> 00:01:53.672
He was at the bottom of some steps.

28
00:01:54.773 --> 00:01:56.334
Vinnie took the photo out.

29
00:01:56.354 --> 00:02:01.837
“The next adventure begins,” Vinnie said excitedly.

30
00:02:02.637 --> 00:02:06.959
Suddenly, the attic door swung open and Mandy ran in.

31
00:02:06.979 --> 00:02:09.980
“I knew you’d be here!”

32
00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:12.101
she shouted angrily.

33
00:02:12.121 --> 00:02:14.822
“No time to argue!”

34
00:02:15.482 --> 00:02:17.463
Vinnie said, grabbing her arm.

35
00:02:17.483 --> 00:02:21.205
“Look!” He showed her the new photo.

36
00:02:22.025 --> 00:02:22.906
Mandy stared.

37
00:02:22.926 --> 00:02:24.906
“Where is this?”

38
00:02:25.507 --> 00:02:26.067
she asked.

39
00:02:27.047 --> 00:02:30.973
Before Vinnie could answer, the picture glowed very brightly.

40
00:02:32.274 --> 00:02:34.355
The children had to close their eyes.

41
00:02:35.376 --> 00:02:38.177
Soon they were falling down a deep dark tunnel.

42
00:02:38.197 --> 00:02:43.480
“Whoa!” “Ouch!”

43
00:02:45.881 --> 00:02:48.923
Vinnie and Mandy landed heavily on wet ground.

44
00:02:48.943 --> 00:02:51.664
“We landed in mud!”

45
00:02:52.325 --> 00:02:53.085
Mandy said.

46
00:02:54.006 --> 00:02:55.386
Their clothes were changed.

47
00:02:56.147 --> 00:02:58.208
She wore a sleeveless cotton dress.

48
00:02:59.248 --> 00:03:01.570
Vinnie wore something like a short skirt.

49
00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:04.112
“Where are we?”

50
00:03:04.893 --> 00:03:06.154
Mandy looked around.

51
00:03:06.174 --> 00:03:09.196
“We’re on a tiny island!”

52
00:03:09.957 --> 00:03:10.698
Vinnie cried.

53
00:03:10.718 --> 00:03:12.939
“I think we’re in a lake!”

54
00:03:13.940 --> 00:03:17.443
Vinnie noticed that Mandy wore a sparkly bead bracelet.

55
00:03:18.164 --> 00:03:19.345
“What’s that?”

56
00:03:19.885 --> 00:03:20.606
Vinnie asked.

57
00:03:20.626 --> 00:03:24.749
“Mom bought it for me,” said Mandy.

58
00:03:24.769 --> 00:03:27.932
“It’s an early birthday present.”

59
00:03:28.916 --> 00:03:31.619
“Why did you come home from shopping so quickly?”

60
00:03:32.239 --> 00:03:33.140
her brother asked.

61
00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:37.984
“Mom forgot her grocery list, so we had to come back.”

62
00:03:39.085 --> 00:03:42.689
Mandy remembered that Vinnie almost went on this trip alone.

63
00:03:42.709 --> 00:03:49.175
“Hey! You went to the attic without me,” she scolded.

64
00:03:49.195 --> 00:03:51.917
“So?” said Vinnie.

65
00:03:53.058 --> 00:03:54.920
“You didn’t have to go shopping!”

66
00:03:56.624 --> 00:03:59.409
The children argued, forgetting where they were.

67
00:04:00.511 --> 00:04:03.195
Suddenly someone jumped out of the water.

68
00:04:04.597 --> 00:04:07.361
Mandy screamed and startled Vinnie.

69
00:04:07.842 --> 00:04:11.268
He jumped backward, slipped, and fell into the lake.
